===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ap/|[ʔäpʰ]|a=Standard German}}
* {{IPA|de|/ab̥/|a=Switzerland}}
* {{audio|de|De-ab-.ogg}}

===Prefix===
{{head|de|prefix}}

# {{n-g|Separable verb prefix that indicates removal or quitting,}} [[off]], [[away]].
